{"id":"216dbd76b0f27a99","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Boolean Valued Semantics","display":"df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics — ZFC Logic9 Boolean Valued Semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics — ZFC Logic9 Boolean Valued Semantics","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics — ZFC Logic9 Boolean Valued Semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\">\\(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,M,N,v\\in V\">\\(J,M,N,v\\in V\\)</span> (join, meet, a set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-names, and a set-coded atomic valuation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a>); write <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_B b\">\\(a\\Rightarrow_B b\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_Ba\\vee_Bb\">\\(\\neg_Ba\\vee_Bb\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BooleanValuedSemantics}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BooleanValuedSemantics}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}semantics} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BooleanValuedSemantics}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B,N,v)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land\\forall\\tau\\in N\\;(\\tau\\subseteq N\\times B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,2\\times N\\times N,B)\\land\\exists J,M\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\mathcal P(B),B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\mathcal P(B),B)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl[\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\wedge_BJ(A)=a)\\land\\forall u\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\wedge_Bu=a))\\to J(A)\\wedge_Bu=J(A)\\bigr)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(M(A)\\wedge_Ba=M(A))\\land\\forall \\ell\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\ell\\wedge_Ba=\\ell))\\to\\ell\\wedge_BM(A)=\\ell\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in N\\;\\Bigl(v(\\langle0,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle)=J(\\{b\\wedge_Bv(\\langle1,\\sigma,\\rho\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\tau\\})\\land v(\\langle1,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle)=M(\\{b\\Rightarrow_Bv(\\langle0,\\rho,\\tau\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\})\\wedge_BM(\\{b\\Rightarrow_Bv(\\langle0,\\rho,\\sigma\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\tau\\})\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}semantics} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BooleanValuedSemantics}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B,N,v)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land\\forall\\tau\\in N\\;(\\tau\\subseteq N\\times B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,2\\times N\\times N,B)\\land\\exists J,M\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\mathcal P(B),B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\mathcal P(B),B)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl[\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\wedge_BJ(A)=a)\\land\\forall u\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\wedge_Bu=a))\\to J(A)\\wedge_Bu=J(A)\\bigr)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(M(A)\\wedge_Ba=M(A))\\land\\forall \\ell\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\ell\\wedge_Ba=\\ell))\\to\\ell\\wedge_BM(A)=\\ell\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in N\\;\\Bigl(v(\\langle0,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle)=J(\\{b\\wedge_Bv(\\langle1,\\sigma,\\rho\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\tau\\})\\land v(\\langle1,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle)=M(\\{b\\Rightarrow_Bv(\\langle0,\\rho,\\tau\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\})\\wedge_BM(\\{b\\Rightarrow_Bv(\\langle0,\\rho,\\sigma\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\tau\\})\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is a set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-names closed under names occurring in their graphs, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> is a set function on the two atomic relation codes (membership and equality).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> are explicit total join and meet operations; no quantification over the proper class of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-names occurs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}$ (see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]]); write $a\\Rightarrow_B b$ for $\\neg_Ba\\vee_Bb$","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"J,M,N,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\Rightarrow_B b","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_Ba\\vee_Bb","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BooleanValuedSemantics}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}semantics} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BooleanValuedSemantics}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B,N,v)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land\\forall\\tau\\in N\\;(\\tau\\subseteq N\\times B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,2\\times N\\times N,B)\\land\\exists J,M\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\mathcal P(B),B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\mathcal P(B),B)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl[\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\wedge_BJ(A)=a)\\land\\forall u\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\wedge_Bu=a))\\to J(A)\\wedge_Bu=J(A)\\bigr)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(M(A)\\wedge_Ba=M(A))\\land\\forall \\ell\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\ell\\wedge_Ba=\\ell))\\to\\ell\\wedge_BM(A)=\\ell\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in N\\;\\Bigl(v(\\langle0,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle)=J(\\{b\\wedge_Bv(\\langle1,\\sigma,\\rho\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\tau\\})\\land v(\\langle1,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle)=M(\\{b\\Rightarrow_Bv(\\langle0,\\rho,\\tau\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\})\\wedge_BM(\\{b\\Rightarrow_Bv(\\langle0,\\rho,\\sigma\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,b\\rangle\\in\\tau\\})\\Bigr)\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":2169,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2488","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-boolean-valued-semantics]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a5e10857074b912e","36d7463d215be751"]}